# Clips and frames REGENERATE from `bun tools/flight-capture.mjs`, and the
# receipt records the sha256 of each one -- so the evidence is reproducible and
# checkable without carrying a megabyte of H.264 in the history. The receipt
# and the telemetry ARE committed: they are the measurements, the mp4 is the
# illustration.
out/*.mp4
out/frames-*/
